{
  "_README": [
    "Blind-validation ledger. A mechanical want COUNTS only once at least one",
    "author who never saw its expected values (nor anyone else's queries) has",
    "satisfied it from its wording alone \u2014 the wants.rs guard enforces this,",
    "so an unvalidated want fails the build rather than silently counting.",
    "Relations are computed from other wants and are exempt. Judged wants have",
    "no mechanical expectation to validate.",
    "Run a validation with: examples/blind_report.rs against an answers file",
    "produced by an isolated author given the redacted wants (id, probes,",
    "intent, columns, order_matters \u2014 never rows/n)."
